<title>SPAIN: Metrovacesa pretax to Sept up 13.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Metrovacesa pretax to Sept up 13.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Metrovacesa for the nine months to Sept in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit			 5.07	 up   13.8</p>
<p> Net taxed			     4.35	 up   10.6</p>
<p> Rental income			 5.73	 up   17.2</p>
</text>
